WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.670
- So has it been nice to have
Dwayne at home since retiring?

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.042
Is that nice?
(Dwayne clears throat)

00:00:04.042 --> 00:00:05.927
- It has, it has, it has,
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:05.927 --> 00:00:07.770
it has gotten nice.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.210
- Mm-kay.
- You know, initially,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.350
like, you know, we've been, you know-

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.290
our careers sort of
were on opposite coasts.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.123
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- So we were

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:15.360
never really home together

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.010
for long stretches of time.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.330
So it would be like every morning-

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.390
Oh! There you are. Um.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.540
Okay. But over time- Look at his face!

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.380
Over time-

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.213
- [Kelly] It's probably weird for you too.

00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:27.270
- It's awesome.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.103
- Thank you, thank you.
- It's awesome.

00:00:28.103 --> 00:00:28.936
- [Kelly] It's like musicians.

00:00:28.936 --> 00:00:29.820
- No one ever asks me, is it weird?

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.110
- No, no, you know why?

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.790
It's like, 'cause that's, like musicians,

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.990
like we're on the road all the time

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.729
and that can be hard,
like in a relationship.

00:00:35.729 --> 00:00:37.800
And then you try and like almost

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.120
put yourself in this situation.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.890
The family's already kind
of doing its own thing

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:41.723
while you've been gone.

00:00:41.723 --> 00:00:42.556
- Yes.
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:42.556 --> 00:00:43.560
- [Kelly] So that's hard.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.393
- Yes.
- Yeah.

00:00:44.393 --> 00:00:45.226
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- So I just had to be quiet

00:00:45.226 --> 00:00:46.115
for like the first six months.

00:00:46.115 --> 00:00:48.169
- (laughs) Good job.
- [Dwyane] Yeah.

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:49.002
Just shut up
- That's hard.

00:00:49.002 --> 00:00:49.835
- and listen.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:53.010
And now I found my space
now in the house, so.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:53.843
- [Kelly] I love that.
- Yeah.

00:00:53.843 --> 00:00:54.880
The rent I pay,
- [Kelly] That's tricky.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:55.713
Yeah.
- Yeah,

00:00:55.713 --> 00:00:56.970
I feel like I'm getting my money's worth.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.084
- I get my money. (laughs and claps)

00:00:58.084 --> 00:00:58.950
(audience claps)

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.060
I'm a part, I'm a part.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.193
- Get my money's worth.

